# Responsive Navbar

## Description
A responsive navigation bar built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It automatically adapts to desktop, tablet, and mobile screen sizes. On smaller screens, the navigation links are hidden behind a hamburger menu that can be toggled using JavaScript.

## Features
- Responsive Design
- Hamburger Menu
- Smooth Hover Effects
- Mobile Friendly
- Clean UI
- HTML, CSS & JavaScript

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

